{
  "proposals": [
    {
      "path": "libffi/agent/simple-actions-1.json",
      "reason": "仓库为libffi git源码，根目录没有生成的configure，存在autogen.sh（exec autoreconf -v -i）。README的\"Installing libffi\"说明从git源码需先运行./autogen.sh（需要autoconf/automake/libtool），随后在构建目录运行configure，再执行make（GNU make）。因此采用autogen生成configure、out-of-tree configure、make -j2构建默认主目标（libffi库）。",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "autogen",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "./autogen.sh"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "configure",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "mkdir -p build && cd build && ../configure"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "build",
          "role": "build",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo/build",
          "command": "make -j2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "libffi/agent/simple-actions-2.json",
      "reason": "已观察：autogen.sh(仅 exec autoreconf -v -i) 在 configure.ac:219 处失败，报 \"possibly undefined macro: LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE\"（libtoolize 已把系统 libtool 的 m4 宏复制进 m4/，但其中不含该宏），说明镜像自带的 libtool 版本已移除 configure.ac 依赖的 LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE 宏；README.md:137-139 明确构建需要 autoconf/automake/libtool。README.md:131-135,190-191 说明在构建目录运行 configure 后 make。拟执行：把 libtool 2.4.6（其 m4 仍提供 LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE）以源码方式安装到 /workspace/dependencies/libtool/install，用其 bin 前缀与宏路径重跑 autoreconf -f 生成 configure，然后按作者说明在 build/ 内配置并 make 构建默认库目标，不改动源码与测试。仍缺的依据：2.4.6 的宏是否满足由实际 execute 反馈确认；下载源可用性未知。",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "libtool_fetch",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool",
          "command": "mkdir -p /workspace/dependencies/libtool && cd /workspace/dependencies/libtool && curl -fsSL -o libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/libtool/libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz && tar xzf libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "libtool_configure",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool/libtool-2.4.6",
          "command": "./configure --prefix=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "libtool_build_install",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool/libtool-2.4.6",
          "command": "make -j2 && make install"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "autogen",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/bin:$PATH ACLOCAL_PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/share/aclocal autoreconf -v -i -f"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "configure",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "mkdir -p build && cd build && ../configure"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "build",
          "role": "build",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo/build",
          "command": "make -j2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "libffi/agent/simple-actions-3.json",
      "reason": "已观察：上一条 libtool_fetch 失败的直接原因是容器无法进入 /workspace/dependencies/libtool（命令里才 mkdir，workdir 在执行前已由容器校验），并非 libtool 源码本身的问题；且 2.4.6 与镜像内已装的 2.4.7 同属 2.4.x，用“2.4.6 宏集”替代系统 libtool 的依据不足，故不再由源码装 libtool。已读材料显示仓库是 autotools 工程（configure.ac:219 使用 LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE、autogen.sh 首行 exec autoreconf -v -i、README 110-190 说明先 autogen 再在子目录 configure 并用 make），因此按作者推荐顺序：用仓库自带 autogen.sh 生成 configure，再在 build 子目录 configure，最后 make 默认目标。对“系统 libtool.m4 是否提供该宏”仍缺直接证据，交由真实执行反馈确认；本方案不改源码、不减组件。",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "autogen",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "sh ./autogen.sh"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "configure",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "mkdir -p build && cd build && ../configure"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "build",
          "role": "build",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo/build",
          "command": "make -j2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "libffi/agent/simple-actions-4.json",
      "reason": "已观察到 autogen 失败：系统 libtool 2.4.7 的宏集中不再提供 configure.ac 第 219 行所需的 LT_SYS_SYMBOL_USCORE，autoconf 因此报 possibly undefined macro。为保持作者原有的 autogen/configure/make 构建语义，改为在受管前缀构建 libtool 2.4.6 并用其 libtoolize/aclocal 重新生成构建系统；随后仍在仓库内独立构建目录配置和编译默认主目标。",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step_id": "dep_libtool_fetch",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "mkdir -p /workspace/dependencies/libtool/src && curl -fL --retry 2 https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/libtool/libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz -o /workspace/dependencies/libtool/libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz && tar -xzf /workspace/dependencies/libtool/libtool-2.4.6.tar.gz -C /workspace/dependencies/libtool/src --strip-components=1"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "dep_libtool_configure",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool/src",
          "command": "./configure --prefix=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "dep_libtool_build",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool/src",
          "command": "make -j2"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "dep_libtool_install",
          "role": "dependency",
          "workdir": "/workspace/dependencies/libtool/src",
          "command": "make install"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "autogen",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/bin:$PATH ACLOCAL_PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/share/aclocal libtoolize --copy --force && PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/bin:$PATH ACLOCAL_PATH=/workspace/dependencies/libtool/install/share/aclocal autoreconf -v -i -f"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "configure",
          "role": "configure",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo",
          "command": "mkdir -p build && cd build && ../configure"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "build",
          "role": "build",
          "workdir": "/workspace/repo/build",
          "command": "make -j2"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
